OL,2,V55555555CCHECK CANCER TESTS,
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CWOMEN URGED
OL,4,B
OL,5, Women who have undergone cervical smear
OL,6, tests for cancer in Oxfordshire are
OL,7, being urged to contact their doctors.
OL,8,B
OL,9, Three patients, who were never told the
OL,10, results of their tests, were found to
OL,11, be suffering badly from the disease.
OL,12,B
OL,13, The women are all in their late 20s or
OL,14, early 30s. One died within the past
OL,15, year and the other two are seriously
OL,16, ill.
OL,17,B
OL,18, The county's Community Health Council
OL,19, secretary, Mr Tom Richardson, said the
OL,20, system of warning potential sufferers
OL,21, was "shot through with holes".
OL,23,F]DFrom 16-03-85 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
