OL,2,V55555555CTHATCHER LEADS WAR
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CON SOCCER THUGS
OL,5, The Prime Minister has set up an
OL,6, emergency group of senior Cabinet
OL,7, Ministers to combat football violence.
OL,9, Mrs Thatcher has personally taken
OL,10, charge of the Government drive to stamp
OL,11, out hooliganism, highlighted by this
OL,12, week's riot by Millwall fans at Luton.
OL,14, The new group, which includes Home
OL,15, Secretary Leon Britton and Environment
OL,16, Secretary Patrick Jenkin, will hold its
OL,17, first meeting next week.
OL,19,SGShadow sports minister Denis Howell
OL,20, has criticised police for not being
OL,21, aware of possible trouble at recent
OL,22, matches.
OL,23,F]DFrom 16-03-85 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
