CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773658155
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G14/28
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, There has been more violence in South
OL,6, Africa's gold mines.
OL,8,FSeven miners were killed and more than
OL,9,F60 injured in tribal fighting at Vaal
OL,10,FReif mine south-west of Johannesburg.
OL,12,FThe death toll from earlier clashes
OL,13,Fbetween police and workers at the
OL,14,FBlyvooruitzicht mine has risen to
OL,15,Fseven, with the death of a black man in
OL,16,Fhospital.
OL,18,FTribal fighting is generations old in
OL,19,FSouth Africa's mines, but the political
OL,20,Fclimate in the countty has sharpened
OL,21,Fdifferences.
OL,23,T]CFrom 16-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
