OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773658155
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G16/28
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Two more people have been found alive
OL,6, in the rubble of a hotel which fell
OL,7, down in Singapore yesterday.
OL,9,FThis takes the total of those found
OL,10,Falive today to nine.
OL,12,FAll other excavation work has stopped
OL,13,Fwhile these operations take place.
OL,15,FNine people were found alive yesterday
OL,16,Fand seven bodies have been recovered.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FAnother 59 people are still missing.
OL,19,F
OL,21,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 16-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
