OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Swiss voters have rejected a government
OL,6, sponsored proposal for their country
OL,7, to join the United Nations.
OL,9,FFirst results from a referendum showed
OL,10,Fthat about 76 per cent of the country's
OL,11,Fvoters in 26 cantons or local states
OL,12,Fhad rejected membership.
OL,14,FA majority of both cantons and voters
OL,15,Fwould have been needed for the proposal
OL,16,Fto be accepted.
OL,18,FSwitzerland has observer status at the
OL,19,FUN but has never applied for membership
OL,20,Ffor fear of prejudicing its neutrality.
OL,23,T]CFrom 16-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
