OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, India has signed an initial agreement
OL,6, to buy the aircraft carrier Hermes -
OL,7, Britain's Falklands conflict flagship.
OL,9,FThe Press Trust of India news agency
OL,10,Fsays a formal contract, worth about
OL,11,F#60m, would enable the 28,000-tonne
OL,12,Fvessel to be handed over in early 1987.
OL,14,FThe Hermes, which would be India's
OL,15,Fsecond aircraft carrier, was built near
OL,16,Fthe end of World War Two and entered
OL,17,Fservice in the early 1950s.
OL,19,S/FIndia has signed a #6k million deal
OL,20,Fto buy 21 helicopters from the British
OL,21,FWestland company.
OL,23,T]CFrom 16-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
